  "referenceNumber": "RUS0204",
  "remarks": "\nStroygazmontazh-Most OOO is a subsidiary of lead contractor Stroygazmontazh thatmanages the construction project of the bridge over the Kerch Strait. Furthermore, it is ownedby an individual Arkady Rotenberg, who is already designated for his actions underminingUkrainian sovereignty. Therefore the company is supporting the consolidation of the illegallyannexed Crimean peninsula into the Russian Federation, which further undermines theterritorial integrity, sovereignty and independence of Ukraine. The trust services sanctions were imposed on 21/03/2023.",
